title: Party Unity
subtitle: Manage the party's quarrels.
card-image: img/cards/party_disunity.svg?v=2
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_disunity_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 6

[? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 0 and dix < 20 : The Revolutionary Defencists hold the Soviet and the ministries; Martov's Internationalists have the best speakers and the sharpest pens. The party has always been a party of tendencies, and the tendencies do not like one another. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 1 and dix < 36 : Since the Extraordinary Congress in December the Internationalists have led the party, and Potresov's people on the right say openly that it is no longer theirs. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 : The right wants to fight the Bolsheviks beside anyone who will fight them; Martov wants a legal opposition inside the soviets. Members who go south to the Whites are expelled, and members who go into the Red Army are not, and each wing says the other is destroying the party. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 : Half the Central Committee is in the Butyrki prison. In the cells the old quarrels go on as before, and notes on cigarette paper carry them out to the other half. ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and bol_regime = 0 and dix >= 20 : The Republic has made the party's quarrels smaller and more bitter. They are about ministries now, and seats on committees, more than about principles. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 0 and dix < 20 : The party has grown from a few thousand members to a million since March, and every new member has brought his own idea of what an SR is. The right, the centre and the left share one Central Committee and agree on little but the land. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 1 and dix < 36 : The Fourth Congress met in December with the Bolsheviks in power and the Left SRs gone, and found that the party still had a right and a left. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 : One wing wants a people's army on the Volga; another wants to stop fighting the Bolsheviks while the Whites are at the gates. Volsky's group has already made its own peace with Moscow, and others are thinking of it. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 : The Central Committee is in prison, awaiting a trial that the Bolsheviks promise will be public. What is left of the party argues in letters carried in and out of the cells. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and bol_regime = 0 and dix >= 20 : The largest party of the Republic has the quarrels of a large party: over the ministries, over the land law, and over how far to trust the Kadets. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 0 : The left of the SR party is not yet a party of its own. Its members argue about when to leave the old party, and whether to leave it at all. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 0 : The Left SRs have a party of their own now, and the old quarrels of the SR party have followed them into it. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix < 36 : The peace with Germany divides the party as it divides the Bolsheviks. Some would sign it to save the revolution; Kamkov and Karelin would sooner fight a revolutionary war. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 36 and dix < 96 : The party loses members at both ends: to the Bolsheviks, who offer them posts, and to the underground, which offers them a cause. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 and lsr_in_gov = 1 : The party is still in the government, and quarrels over each commissariat that the Bolsheviks take back from it. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_split = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 and lsr_in_gov = 0 : Many of the leaders are in prison or abroad. The quarrels are carried on by those who are left, with all the old heat. ?] Whom will you spend the time to reassure? (Internal dissent: [+ d_dissent : dissent +].)

- @intl: [+ flabel_intl +].
- @defencist: [+ flabel_defencist +].
- @rightdef: [+ flabel_rightdef +].
- @unions: [+ flabel_unions +].
- @bund: [+ flabel_bund +].
- @all: A party conference for everyone.
- @easy_discard

@intl
view-if: intl_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -10);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 2);
!}

A column in the paper and a place on the executive committee have been found for [+ ilbl +]. They are, for a time, content.

@defencist
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, -8);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 2);
!}

[+ Dlbl +] have been reassured that the line will not change. The left wing is suspicious.

@rightdef
view-if: rightdef_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, -10);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 3);
!}

[+ Rlbl +] were flattered with an invitation to write the editorial. They will not stay flattered long.

@unions
view-if: unions_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, -8);
!}

[+ flabel_unions +] want to be consulted on every important decision, and have been promised that they will be.

@bund
view-if: bund_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 0, -8);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 1);
!}

[+ flabel_bund +] are a current with its own press, its own members and its own memory. They have been promised a voice in the committee.

@all
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A conference costs a resource.
on-arrival: {!
RO.pay(Q, 1);
for (var f of Q.factions) { RO.fac(Q, f, 0, -4); }
!}

[? if bol_regime = 0 : A conference allowed everyone to speak, and everyone did. It ran four days. Tempers are lower. ?][? if bol_regime = 1 and dix < 96 : A conference met in a Moscow flat, with a lookout on the stairs and the delegates' names known only to the secretary. Everyone spoke. Tempers are lower. ?][? if bol_regime = 1 and dix >= 96 : A conference met as much by letter as in person: a third of the delegates were in prison and sent their speeches in. Tempers are lower. ?]
